{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 26,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Beware of Personal Favoritism"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My brethren, do not hold the faith of our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of glory, with partiality. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if there should come into your assembly a man with gold rings, in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "bright"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fine apparel, and there should also come in a poor man in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "vile"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "filthy clothes, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. look upon"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "pay attention to the one wearing the fine clothes and say to him, “You sit here in a good place,” and say to the poor man, “You stand there,” or, “Sit here at my footstool,” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "have you not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "differentiated"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shown partiality among yourselves, and become judges with evil thoughts?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Listen, my beloved brethren: Has God not chosen the poor of this world "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rich in faith and heirs of the kingdom which He promised to those who love Him? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you have dishonored the poor man. Do not the rich oppress you and drag you into the courts? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do they not blaspheme that noble name by which you are called?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If you really fulfill "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " royal law according to the Scripture, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall love your neighbor as yourself,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you do well; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but if you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. receive the face"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "show partiality, you commit sin, and are convicted by the law as transgressors. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For whoever shall keep the whole law, and yet stumble in one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "point,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he is guilty of all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He who said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Do not commit adultery,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Do not murder.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Now if you do not commit adultery, but you do murder, you have become a transgressor of the law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So speak and so do as those who will be judged by the law of liberty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For judgment is without mercy to the one who has shown no mercy. Mercy triumphs over judgment."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Faith Without Works Is Dead"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " profit, my brethren, if someone says he has faith but does not have works? Can faith save him? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If a brother or sister is naked and destitute of daily food, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and one of you says to them, “Depart in peace, be warmed and filled,” but you do not give them the things which are needed for the body, what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " profit? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus also faith by itself, if it does not have works, is dead."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But someone will say, “You have faith, and I have works.” Show me your faith without "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "your works, and I will show you my faith by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits my"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "my works. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You believe that there is one God. You do well. Even the demons believe—and tremble! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But do you want to know, O foolish man, that faith without works is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU useless"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dead? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Was not Abraham our father justified by works when he offered Isaac his son on the altar? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you see that faith was working together with his works, and by works faith was made "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "complete"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perfect? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the Scripture was fulfilled which says, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Abraham believed God, and it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "credited"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "accounted to him for righteousness.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And he was called the friend of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You see then that a man is justified by works, and not by faith only."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Likewise, was not Rahab the harlot also justified by works when she received the messengers and sent "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " out another way?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as the body without the spirit is dead, so faith without works is dead also."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}